<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Mystic Moose Lodge — off-grid timber lodge on Flint Creek, Anaconda, Montana</title>
<meta name="description" content="A handcrafted timber lodge on 25 acres in the Montana Rockies, with 1,400 feet of creek frontage, a waterfall, and a wood-fired cedar sauna. Sleeps 12.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Young+Serif&family=Karla:ital,wght@0,300..700;1,300..700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --spruce:#16231E;
  --pine:#24382E;
  --creek:#8FB6AC;
  --birch:#E9EAE5;
  --paper:#F3F3F0;
  --cedar:#A8825A;
  --stone:#767D77;
  --measure:34rem;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
body{
  margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--spruce);
  font-family:"Karla",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Young Serif",Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.06;margin:0}
p{margin:0 0 1.1em}
a{color:inherit}
img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}

/* ---- nav ---- */
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:30;padding:18px 28px;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  color:var(--birch);mix-blend-mode:difference;pointer-events:none}
nav .mark{font-family:"Young Serif",serif;font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:.01em}
nav ul{display:flex;gap:26px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:.86rem;pointer-events:auto}
nav a{text-decoration:none;opacity:.85}
nav a:hover,nav a:focus-visible{opacity:1;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}
@media(max-width:720px){nav ul{display:none}}

/* ---- hero ---- */
.hero{position:relative;height:100svh;min-height:560px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--spruce)}
.hero>img{position:absolute;inset:0;animation:slowpan 26s ease-out forwards}
@keyframes slowpan{from{transform:scale(1.08)}to{transform:scale(1)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.hero>img{animation:none}}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(22,35,30,.42) 0%,rgba(22,35,30,0) 32%,rgba(22,35,30,.30) 62%,rgba(22,35,30,.88) 100%)}
.hero-copy{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:0 28px 7vh;color:var(--birch)}
.hero-copy .inner{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto}
.hero-copy h1{font-size:clamp(2.9rem,8.2vw,6.4rem);letter-spacing:-.015em;max-width:15ch}
.hero-copy p{margin:20px 0 0;max-width:40ch;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.18rem);color:#D6DDD7}
.hero-where{font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--creek);margin-bottom:18px}

/* ---- sections ---- */
section{padding:clamp(68px,10vw,132px) 0}
.lede{max-width:var(--measure)}
.lede p{font-size:1.22rem;line-height:1.62}
.lede p:first-child::first-letter{
  font-family:"Young Serif",serif;float:left;font-size:3.6em;line-height:.82;
  padding:.06em .1em 0 0;color:var(--pine)}

/* ---- land table ---- */
.land{margin-top:64px;border-top:1px solid rgba(22,35,30,.16)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.98rem}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(22,35,30,.11);vertical-align:baseline}
th{font-weight:500;color:var(--stone);width:44%;font-size:.9rem}
td{font-family:"Young Serif",serif;font-size:1.16rem}
@media(min-width:760px){.land{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 64px}}

/* ---- full bleed band ---- */
.band{position:relative;color:var(--birch);background:var(--spruce);padding:0}
.band-img{position:relative;height:clamp(420px,64vh,720px)}
.band-img::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(22,35,30,.15),rgba(22,35,30,.82))}
.band-copy{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding:0 28px clamp(36px,6vw,72px);z-index:2}
.band-copy .inner{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:22px}
@media(min-width:860px){.band-copy .inner{grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;align-items:end;gap:56px}}
.bignum{font-family:"Young Serif",serif;font-size:clamp(3.4rem,9vw,7rem);line-height:.86;color:var(--creek)}
.bignum span{display:block;font-family:"Karla",sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;color:#C3CFC8;margin-top:14px;line-height:1.5;max-width:26ch}
.band-copy p{max-width:44ch;color:#D6DDD7;margin:0}

/* ---- sauna split ---- */
.split{display:grid;gap:6px}
@media(min-width:820px){.split{grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr}}
.split .a{height:clamp(320px,52vh,600px)}
.split .b{height:clamp(240px,52vh,600px)}
.sauna-text{margin-top:44px;max-width:var(--measure)}

/* ---- gallery ---- */
.gal{display:grid;gap:6px;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
@media(min-width:880px){.gal{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);grid-auto-rows:170px}}
.gal figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:var(--pine);min-height:180px}
.gal img{transition:transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.gal figure:hover img{transform:scale(1.035)}
.gal figcaption{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;padding:14px 16px;color:var(--birch);
  font-size:.84rem;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(22,35,30,.8))}
@media(min-width:880px){
  .g1{grid-column:span 4;grid-row:span 2}
  .g2{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .g3{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .g4{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .g5{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .g6{grid-column:span 3;grid-row:span 2}
  .g7{grid-column:span 3;grid-row:span 2}
}

/* ---- sleeping ---- */
.sleep{display:grid;gap:46px;margin-top:56px}
@media(min-width:820px){.sleep{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.rooms{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.rooms li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:13px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(22,35,30,.11)}
.rooms b{font-weight:500}
.rooms span{color:var(--stone);text-align:right}

/* ---- know ---- */
.know{background:var(--spruce);color:var(--birch)}
.know h2{color:var(--birch)}
.know .grid{display:grid;gap:38px;margin-top:52px}
@media(min-width:780px){.know .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:44px 64px}}
.know h3{font-size:1.28rem;color:var(--creek);margin-bottom:10px}
.know p{color:#C3CFC8;margin:0;max-width:42ch}

/* ---- book ---- */
.book{text-align:left;background:var(--birch)}
.book .inner{max-width:var(--measure)}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:26px;padding:17px 34px;background:var(--spruce);color:var(--birch);
  text-decoration:none;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.01em;border:1px solid var(--spruce);
  transition:background .25s,color .25s}
.btn:hover,.btn:focus-visible{background:transparent;color:var(--spruce)}
.terms{margin-top:26px;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--stone)}

h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.3rem);letter-spacing:-.01em;max-width:18ch}
.sub{color:var(--stone);margin-top:18px;max-width:var(--measure)}

footer{background:var(--spruce);color:#8FA097;padding:56px 0;font-size:.88rem}
footer .inner{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;justify-content:space-between}
footer a{color:var(--creek)}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--creek);outline-offset:3px}

.enquiry{margin-top:38px;max-width:46rem}
.enquiry .row{display:grid;gap:18px}
@media(min-width:640px){.enquiry .row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.enquiry label{display:block;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--stone)}
.enquiry input,.enquiry textarea{
  display:block;width:100%;margin-top:7px;padding:13px 14px;
  font:inherit;font-size:1rem;color:var(--spruce);
  background:var(--paper);border:1px solid rgba(22,35,30,.22);border-radius:0;
  transition:border-color .2s}
.enquiry input:focus,.enquiry textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--pine);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(143,182,172,.35)}
.enquiry textarea{resize:vertical}
.enquiry .btn{margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}
.book .terms a{color:var(--pine)}
.book .inner{max-width:var(--measure)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <span class="mark">Mystic Moose Lodge</span>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#land">The land</a></li>
    <li><a href="#sauna">Sauna</a></li>
    <li><a href="#house">The house</a></li>
    <li><a href="#book">Enquire</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="The lodge seen across the front lawn with Flint Creek running through it, forested ridge behind">
  <div class="hero-copy"><div class="inner">
    <div class="hero-where">North Fork Flint Creek — Anaconda, Montana</div>
    <h1>A timber lodge with a creek through the lawn</h1>
    <p>Twenty-five acres of Montana. Built by hand, off the grid, and finished this year.</p>
  </div></div>
</header>

<section id="land">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="lede">
      <p>The family who built this place milled the timber from trees standing on the property. The frame went up bay by bay, the boards came off the same ground they now shelter, and the whole thing was finished in 2026. You would be among the first people to stay here.</p>
      <p>It sits in a clearing at the bottom of a forested draw, with the North Fork of Flint Creek running between the house and the treeline — close enough that you hear it from the deck and from most of the bedrooms with a window open.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="land">
      <table>
        <tr><th>Land</th><td>25.48 acres</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Creek frontage</th><td>1,400+ feet</td></tr>
        <tr><th>House</th><td>3,088 sq ft</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Built</th><td>2026</td></tr>
      </table>
      <table>
        <tr><th>Sleeps</th><td>12 across 5 rooms</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Bathrooms</th><td>2 full</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Nearest town</th><td>Anaconda or Philipsburg, 30 min</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Power &amp; water</th><td>Solar, propane, well, septic</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="band">
  <div class="band-img">
    <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A small waterfall dropping into a clear trout pool, with the sauna house on the bank above">
  </div>
  <div class="band-copy"><div class="inner">
    <div class="bignum">1,400 ft<span>of the North Fork running through the property</span></div>
    <p>The creek drops over a granite lip into a clear pool deep enough to swim in and cold enough that you will not linger. Trout hold in it. There is a bench on the bank, and a log bridge across.</p>
  </div></div>
</div>

<section id="sauna">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>A cedar sauna at the water's edge</h2>
    <p class="sub">Wood-fired, with its own deck looking back over the falls.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="split" style="margin-top:44px">
    <div class="a"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="The cedar sauna house on the far bank, deck overhanging the creek"></div>
    <div class="b"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Inside the sauna: cedar benches and a wood-fired stove topped with stones"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="sauna-text">Light it a few hours before you want it — this is a real wood stove, not a switch on a wall. Then the sequence that makes the whole property worth the drive: sit until you cannot stand it, walk thirty feet, and get into the creek.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="house">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Inside</h2>
    <p class="sub">Vaulted ceilings, exposed beams, a wood stove in the main room, and a full kitchen built for feeding a crowd.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap" style="margin-top:44px">
    <div class="gal">
      <figure class="g1"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Living room with a stone-backed wood stove and vaulted timber ceiling"><figcaption>Wood stove in the main room</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="g2"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Kitchen with granite counters and timber beams"><figcaption>Kitchen</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="g3"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Dining table for eight beside a door to the deck"><figcaption>Dining, with the deck door</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="g4"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Bedroom with a king bed and a window onto the forest"><figcaption>King bedroom</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="g5"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Loft under the timber rafters with a queen bed and bunks"><figcaption>The loft</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="g6"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="The deck running along the creek with seating and a grill"><figcaption>The deck, over the water</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="g7"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Bathroom with an arched tiled shower and stone counter"><figcaption>One of two bathrooms</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sleep">
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:8px">Where everyone sleeps</h3>
        <ul class="rooms">
          <li><b>Bedroom one</b><span>King</span></li>
          <li><b>Bedroom two</b><span>Queen</span></li>
          <li><b>Bedroom three</b><span>Queen</span></li>
          <li><b>Bedroom four</b><span>Queen</span></li>
          <li><b>The loft</b><span>Queen, bunk, single</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:8px">What's here</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--stone)">Full kitchen with fridge, stove, coffee and the basics. Washer and dryer. Starlink wifi and a TV. Wood stove and heating throughout. Hot water, towels and linens, hair dryer, hangers. Outdoor furniture and a grill on the deck. Free parking, right at the door.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="know">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Before you book</h2>
    <p class="sub" style="color:#C3CFC8">Off-grid is the appeal, and it is also the thing to plan around. None of this is a surprise if you read it now.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <h3>There is almost no cell service</h3>
        <p>Signal is spotty at best anywhere on the property. Starlink wifi is your reliable connection. Tell someone where you are going before you come.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Power, water, waste</h3>
        <p>Solar and propane, a well, and a septic system. Keep showers short, turn lights off behind you, and put nothing down the toilet but toilet paper.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Arrive stocked</h3>
        <p>The nearest groceries are half an hour out, in either Anaconda or Philipsburg. Bring what you plan to eat.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Getting here in fall</h3>
        <p>The last stretch is gravel and fine for any passenger car through the fall. Winter access is a different question — ask us before booking outside the open season.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>The creek is not a swimming pool</h3>
        <p>Cold, fast, and slick underfoot, with help a long way off. Children need an adult with them near the water, always.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Two wood stoves</h3>
        <p>One in the house, one in the sauna. Doors stay shut once lit, and the damper settings stay where they are — they are set the way they are for a reason.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="book" id="book">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="inner">
    <h2>Ask us about a stay</h2>
    <p class="sub">Tell us when you'd like to come and who's coming, and we'll get back to you with availability and a price. We read every message ourselves.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:mysticmooselodge@gmail.com?subject=Enquiry%20about%20a%20stay%20at%20Mystic%20Moose%20Lodge&amp;body=Hello%2C%0A%0AWe%27d%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20staying%20at%20the%20lodge.%0A%0AArriving%3A%0ALeaving%3A%0ANumber%20of%20people%3A%0A%0AAnything%20else%20you%20should%20know%3A%0A%0AThank%20you%2C%0A">Email us about dates</a>
    <p class="terms">Or write to us directly at <a href="mailto:mysticmooselodge@gmail.com">mysticmooselodge@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <p class="terms">Two-night minimum, twelve people maximum. No pets, no smoking, no parties. Give us a day to reply.</p>
  </div></div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <span>Mystic Moose Lodge — 383 Red Lion Rd, Anaconda, Montana 59711</span>
    <span>Hosted by Mary &amp; Tom — <a href="mailto:mysticmooselodge@gmail.com">mysticmooselodge@gmail.com</a></span>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
